  "description": "The world's most handsome man, Louis, who not only humans but also monsters fall for him. One day, a plague struck the village. Louis also falls ill and dies... \"Where did my sculptured face go, and what's with this skull?!\" The world's most handsome man, who has become a skeleton that cannot be judged by beauty or ugliness. Will Louis be able to become human again and enjoy the life of a handsome unemployed man?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
